  <revision rev="4" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>98b5b5d11494615e901e2f0304c574a9</srcmd5>
    <version>0.4.2</version>
    <time>1794318252</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 0.4.2
Bugfixes:
  * State files are now created with restricted permissions.
    Previously, only the state directory was protected.
  * ACME server responses with escaped URLs failed to parse.
  * Some non-compliant ACME server responses with missing fields
    failed to parse.
  * Orders for pre-authorized identifiers that omit the
    authorizations field failed to parse.
  * The actual ACME server error was not logged correctly
    if the response had no Replay-Nonce header.
  * Order finalization errors were not logged correctly.
- Add keyring and use source_validator in default mode
- Update to version 0.4.2
Bugfixes:
  * State files are now created with restricted permissions.
    Previously, only the state directory was protected.
  * ACME server responses with escaped URLs failed to parse.
  * Some non-compliant ACME server responses with missing fields
    failed to parse.
  * Orders for pre-authorized identifiers that omit the
    authorizations field failed to parse.
  * The actual ACME server error was not logged correctly
    if the response had no Replay-Nonce header.
  * Order finalization errors were not logged correctly.
- Add keyring and use source_validator in localonly mode</comment>
    <requestid>1396478</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
